4c4dc2075a42028","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Supercharge your thinking and give your brain a boost with the Mental Stimulator!","source_tag":"_t","target":"强化你的思考能力，加速你的大脑！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"14c4985e139edc2678a335f02045bfea8acf37ea5f160e5b298be8dc2a2206d6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"054164c8b16f2c43a12cd19ba818cc158aff63fc530f449cea36108ca5ecd8b1","logical_entry_identity":"ed034662ea84d6fea3ee22560047119d1218ee6b3c0eda9ad33488417951b00c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"basaligator","source_tag":"entity name","target":"蛇蜥魔鳄"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4b468c18f9f75b87b06ccc3337e18a7e0ef527137d6d88018f5c5be932dda38f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"05445d65da0e32cf45ec72ca3d02d686c18455136fca737b12ac9a938f7b9e42","logical_entry_identity":"e43ebdc0be8b312f6afb5db0f2cebe74744c5c8e399239218969a3097d47a1fb","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You are adept at wreaking havoc onto your foes!\n\t\tAny time you deal damage to a creature you apply the Incoming Disasters effect for 20 turns.\n\t\tEach time you (or any others) would try to apply a cross-tier effect to this creature, you also try to apply the other two.\n\t\tIn addition your physical, steam, spell and mind powers are increased by %d.\n\t\tThe powers increase scales of your Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你很擅长给你的敌人带来灾难！\n\t\t任何时候你对一个生物造成伤害，你会对它施加灾难临近效果，持续20回合。\n\t\t每次你（或任何其他目标）尝试对这个生物施加越层效果时，也将尝试施加其他两个越层效果。\n\t\t此外，你的物理，蒸汽，法术和精神强度增加 %d。\n\t\t强度增加值受灵巧值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ad7fdec274de5d3f0e6e1c13458c48ea8c93c179f5f32f9a2554193c3d072bd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"055d53634a0be6319fb00dbd39263da3c6c1bfa86f86dff6db58e3b7eb9ceea7","logical_entry_identity":"0adccaf26e97081d62e47d84568f40567274d89c8c1c98a8e31e8b37722ef844","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"\"So we were thinking. You know what's better than saws? Really BIG saws. Unfortunately, no one could lift them. So we came up with an innovative new solution: Mount them on a motorized platform, allowing easy transportation and unparalleled cutting power!\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们曾经这么想：你知道比锯子更好的是什么吗？巨大的锯子。可惜没人能够拿得动它们。所以我们想了一个新颖的主意：将他们安装在一个移动的平台上，以便让我们方便的运输，并获得无与伦比的切割能力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"047040f7cf0aff1d92b2b4b47fd216d82b5ec8e4114593b85c3a0af9991c0e35","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"055f63740df9192b1323c13cc7468013f34cf62295e31cd70aa26ec135a4d978","logical_entry_identity":"da977b789009821e244c9207b57e3f611f5627c4fd0b1b8ccc10eb111cca8f34","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Horns 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"长角1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6a73267a618ccf7e01ff95c1df9c302b774556ac789a5cf51955a7817d384ae","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"056346a0e269608cd0887579f5141e9549242a8c1e364eaa8f833e5b8599225e","logical_entry_identity":"6a47d767315a969866bf0199abae74ae5ddd5eeb4b341af16b55f90d6adc7616","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"While fighting in a Sunwall zone, use a Fiery Salve to reach at least 66% affinity for Fire and Light. Pointing and laughing is optional.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在晨曦之门的区域内战斗时，开启烈火药剂，并获得至少 66% 火焰和光明吸收。指指点点和嘲笑，随你便。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b23df638bcbff2852035786fee2293fc2f746ff815daf29a93f7c701d72233a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"05789b7f36fc2bbb6a8750f7b3715c9523bb9e09fb5d4d5f47997570f80355f7","logical_entry_identity":"9a9bd762c16bb9feffe30acf0aa339981340281553d907caedbbe4d565a581de","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Ritch Hive","source_tag":"_t","target":"里奇巢穴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"98543cdb5af38e8db9789625479f21a302de32b3198c5aee629ac2dd045cde5f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"059ed0bb12dc938e8a09831cc9f6297f7b199c32bfbf06417ccd72aa6ef2a913","logical_entry_identity":"0e5352f64aa30e756f96074cc777e24805ae6ce2ec6e7201d98ad6a082b7f511","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Strafe","source_tag":